    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TALE FORGED IN ASHES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tsarevna is a visceral action slasher where balletic elegance meets savage combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/17fb9adde1788ab1d36def84a52ae293.poster.avif?t=1755248935\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/17fb9adde1788ab1d36def84a52ae293.webm?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/17fb9adde1788ab1d36def84a52ae293.mp4?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT LIKE A DANCER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is a deadly performance \u2014 every step, pirouette, and strike flows like choreography. Dodge, parry, and unleash seamless combos using enchanted charms and rune-bound powers. Your every move weaves a deadly spectacle. Master the rhythm of battle to unleash emotion-driven magic. But remember: no power comes without sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/69cbb5aa5722a1eaff2f27b964180698.poster.avif?t=1755248935\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/69cbb5aa5722a1eaff2f27b964180698.webm?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/69cbb5aa5722a1eaff2f27b964180698.mp4?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM THE UNDERWORLD TO IRIY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting world reshaped by the dark age\u00a0 \u2014 from crumbling crypts and sunken palaces to frostbitten mountaintops and the forgotten gates of Iriy. Discover ancient relics, uncover the tragedy of a fallen realm, and awaken the truth buried beneath the ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/16e0e0dc2bcfc5da77e0b69c25a75356.poster.avif?t=1755248935\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/16e0e0dc2bcfc5da77e0b69c25a75356.webm?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/16e0e0dc2bcfc5da77e0b69c25a75356.mp4?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHISPERS OF THE OLD GODS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the forgotten shrines of ancient gods. Face the trials they left behind, tempt their wrath, or earn their favor \u2014 and unravel the secret history buried deep in Tsarevna\u2019s bloodline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Wishlist the debut title from WATT Studio \u2014 the first slasher where ballet becomes a weapon, and Slavic myths breathe through every strike.</u></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A TALE FORGED IN ASHES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tsarevna is a visceral action slasher where balletic elegance meets savage combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/17fb9adde1788ab1d36def84a52ae293.poster.avif?t=1755248935\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/17fb9adde1788ab1d36def84a52ae293.webm?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/17fb9adde1788ab1d36def84a52ae293.mp4?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT LIKE A DANCER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is a deadly performance \u2014 every step, pirouette, and strike flows like choreography. Dodge, parry, and unleash seamless combos using enchanted charms and rune-bound powers. Your every move weaves a deadly spectacle. Master the rhythm of battle to unleash emotion-driven magic. But remember: no power comes without sacrifice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/69cbb5aa5722a1eaff2f27b964180698.poster.avif?t=1755248935\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/69cbb5aa5722a1eaff2f27b964180698.webm?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/69cbb5aa5722a1eaff2f27b964180698.mp4?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FROM THE UNDERWORLD TO IRIY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a haunting world reshaped by the dark age\u00a0 \u2014 from crumbling crypts and sunken palaces to frostbitten mountaintops and the forgotten gates of Iriy. Discover ancient relics, uncover the tragedy of a fallen realm, and awaken the truth buried beneath the ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/16e0e0dc2bcfc5da77e0b69c25a75356.poster.avif?t=1755248935\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/16e0e0dc2bcfc5da77e0b69c25a75356.webm?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3348640/extras/16e0e0dc2bcfc5da77e0b69c25a75356.mp4?t=1755248935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHISPERS OF THE OLD GODS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the forgotten shrines of ancient gods. Face the trials they left behind, tempt their wrath, or earn their favor \u2014 and unravel the secret history buried deep in Tsarevna\u2019s bloodline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Wishlist the debut title from WATT Studio \u2014 the first slasher where ballet becomes a weapon, and Slavic myths breathe through every strike.</u></p>",
